<title>TURKEY: SOCCER-KOCALISPOR BEAT TRABZONSPOR 1-0 IN TURKISH CUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KOCALISPOR BEAT TRABZONSPOR 1-0 IN TURKISH CUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kocalispor won the Turkish Cup final after beating Trabzonspor 1-0 (halftime 0-0) in the second leg on Wednesday following their 1-1 first leg draw.</p>
<p>Scorer: Nuri Colak 88.</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000.</p>
</text>
